Package: libgstreamer-plugins-good1.0-0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: GStreamer plugins from the "good" set (shared libraries)
 GStreamer is a streaming media framework, based on graphs of filters
 which operate on media data.  Its plugin-based architecture means that
 new data types or processing capabilities can be added simply by
 installing new plug-ins.
 .
 This package contains the shared libraries of the "good" set: the
 Matroska and FLV demuxers, the RTP payloaders, the Shout and Jack
 support and the audio tag writer.

