Provides: ${gir:Provides}
Description: GStreamer development files for the "good" set
 GStreamer is a streaming media framework, based on graphs of filters
 which operate on media data.  Its plugin-based architecture means that
 new data types or processing capabilities can be added simply by
 installing new plug-ins.
 .
 This package contains the headers, the pkg-config files and the
 introspection data of the "good" set.

Package: gstreamer1.0-plugins-good
Architecture: any
Section: plugins
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         libgstreamer-plugins-good1.0-0 (= ${binary:Version})
Description: GStreamer plugins from the "good" set
 GStreamer is a streaming media framework, based on graphs of filters
 which operate on media data.  Its plugin-based architecture means that
 new data types or processing capabilities can be added simply by
 installing new plug-ins.
 .
 This package contains the elements of the "good" set: the Matroska,
 FLV and RTP demuxers, the VP8 and VP9 codecs, the FLAC, Speex, WavPack,
 AMR, MP3, AAC, Shout and PulseAudio elements.
 .
 This build has no Qt and no GTK video sinks: video is played by mpv
 and by labwc.

Package: gir1.2-gst-plugins-good-1.0
Architecture: any
Section: introspection
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${gir:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: ${gir:Provides}
Description: GObject introspection data for the GStreamer "good" library
 This package contains GObject introspection data for the "good" set of
 the GStreamer streaming media framework.
